      "sourceTextSha256": "bfaa0c0fbd0daa96a7431b0f2bff506650046e7b80c3efa33350c31dbe24822b",
      "text": "The route takes in Bolivia’s highland landscapes, Lake Titicaca, Sun Island, the Uyuni Salt Flats, Andean lagoons and the Siloli Desert. Along the way you’ll see ancient Inca sites, Incahuasi’s giant cacti, flamingos, volcanoes, geysers and hot springs, and take a sightseeing tour of La Paz.",
